  tags: [spec, editable-guard, implemented]
- label: flyout and embed j/k are data-hotkey leaves on the one GitHub-style keyDownHandler; there is no capture-phase document sibling for those printables
  id: edgflydisp
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern "flyout and embed j/k are data-hotkey leaves" test/browser/editable-guard.test.js test/browser/is-form-field.test.js
  tags: [spec, editable-guard, implemented]
- label: while an overlay owns the keyboard, keyDownHandler fires only data-hotkey leaves whose element is inside the top overlay so flyout Next/Prev j/k step peek and unscoped / o g do not
